+<span style="font-weight: bold;"> SECTION 40-57-65.</span> Annual report.<br /><br />
+	The commission shall submit an annual report in accordance with established guidelines to the department and the Chairs of the Senate Labor, Commerce and Industry Committee and House Labor, Commerce and Industry Committee.<br /><br />
+HISTORY: 1997 Act No. 24, SECTION 1; 2016 Act No. 170 (S.1013), SECTION 1, eff January 1, 2017; 2024 Act No. 204 (H.4754), SECTION 3, eff May 21, 2024.<br /><br />
