+	(1) accounting in a timely manner for all money and property related to and received during the relationship; and<br /><br />
+	(2) keeping confidential all information received during the course of the engagement which was made confidential by request or instructions from the client, except as provided for in Section 40-57-350(C)(1)(f) and Section 40-57-350(E)(1)(f) unless the:<br /><br />
