+<div id="" class="opener " style="">
+  <h2>Welcome to the Horry County Register of Deeds website!</h2>
+  
+
+
+<p>As the custodian of land records for Horry County, South Carolina, we are committed to providing efficient and transparent access to vital property information for our community members. Whether you're a homeowner, real estate professional, or researcher, our comprehensive database and resources are here to assist you.</p>
+</div></div>
